m/apps/3589510/extras/b97b33272bcefb835d66a7db926acf34.webm?t=1788789645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/b97b33272bcefb835d66a7db926acf34.mp4?t=1788789645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage and Expand Your Outlet Store</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your store shelves, organize your inventory, and put your unboxed treasures on display. Set competitive prices. As your profits grow, invest back into your business: expand your retail space, buy better repair tools, and unlock higher-quality mystery pallet tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/e28c53637e71fd7876ee820374391037.poster.avif?t=1788789645\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/e28c53637e71fd7876ee820374391037.webm?t=1788789645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/e28c53637e71fd7876ee820374391037.mp4?t=1788789645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Repair at the Workbench</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t throw away damaged goods—fix them! Take broken items from your mystery pallets to your dedicated technical workbench. Replace parts, and repair electronics to drastically skyrocket their market value. Turning a non-functional return into a mint-condition product is where the real profit is made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/8b023b41b1c069198549a486472a957a.poster.avif?t=1788789645\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/8b023b41b1c069198549a486472a957a.mp4?t=1788789645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive Mystery Pallet Loop:</strong> Experience the thrill of unboxing blind pallets with randomized, realistic, and surprising loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair System</strong>: Interact with a hands-on technical workbench to fix smartphones, consoles, household appliances, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Shop Economy:</strong> Repair, price, and display items. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Progression:</strong> Walk through your shop, manually unpack palets, and watch your small business transform into a massive outlet shop. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Returns Outlet Simulator&quot; every choice you make has an impact. Can you step up, turning a small shop into a retail giant while juggling customer happiness and financial stability?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
